n class=\"black-ink\">4. 教师观（老师要求）：</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-1\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">角色：教师是学生学习的促进者。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-3\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">教育教学的研究者。(复杂性)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-3\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">课程的开发者和建设者。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-2\">\n    <span class=\"blue-ink\">开发者 无→有 &nbsp; 建设者 有→优。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-1\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">社区型开放教师：..</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-2\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">行为：&nbsp; 尊重. (对问题学生不打不骂) 赞赏 (表扬)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">帮助引导 </span><span class=\"blue-ink\">(与<span style=\"text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px;\">是学生学习的促进者</span>同意)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">自我反思.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">合作.</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 5: 学生观 -->\n  <div class=\"line section-gap\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">5. 学生观： △ 学生是发展中的人：① 学生</span>\n    <span class=\"insertion-container\">\n      <span class=\"inserted-text\">身心</span>\n      <span class=\"black-ink\">的发展是有规律的。</span>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-3\">\n    <span class=\"blue-ink wavy-underline\">我们要按照学生的身心发展规律进行教育。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">② 学生是具有巨大的发展潜能的。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-3\">\n    <span class=\"blue-ink wavy-underline\">我们要相信，每个学生都会有进步</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">③ 学生是发展过程中的人 </span><span class=\"blue-ink\">(容错)</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-2\">\n    <span class=\"blue-ink wavy-underline\">学生的身心发展尚未发展成熟，要允许学生犯错。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">④ 学生的发展是全面的发展。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line section-gap\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">△ 学生是独特的人：① 与机器人比 → 有情绪、思想。</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-5\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">学生是完整的人</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">② 与其他人比 → 学生有自身的独特性</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"line indent-4\">\n    <span class=\"black-ink\">③ 与成人比 → 学生之间有巨大的差异</span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
